:: MP Daily Robin 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.weekDay is 1 or Time.weekDay is 7>>周末傍晚，<<else>>傍晚收摊后，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>在孤儿院卧室门外支起小木桌清点零钱罐。几个小孤儿围在旁边看画片，<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>见你回来，忙把留着棉花糖的热可可递给你：「今天卖出了二十杯，先尝尝。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_4 is 1>>
今日已帮过忙，先回去歇着。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-4">
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<link "把零钱码齐 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-4">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 230 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_4 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><</if>>账目一分不差，罗宾开心地把多出的几枚铜币塞进共同储蓄盒。<span class="green">罗宾的笑容让整个走廊都暖了起来。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	硬币从桌沿滑落两枚滚进床底，你弯腰去摸时磕到了膝盖。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>连忙蹲下来替你揉了揉膝头。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[弯腰再把零钱码齐 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link "陪小孤儿读书 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-4">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 230 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_4 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><</if>>孩子们听得入神，乖巧地排着队回房睡觉，罗宾感激地牵住你的衣角。<span class="green">你们并肩收拾好木桌准备歇息。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你念错了两个生僻词，小家伙们叽叽喳喳地缠着你追问。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>笑着接过书本替你解了围。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[蹲身再陪小读书 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Robin 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.hour gte 20>>夜深后走廊只留一盏壁灯，<<else>>晚间走廊安静下来后，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>抱着刚缝补好的旧羊毛毯轻轻敲开你的房门。他的耳尖泛红，小声问道：「外头风大，我能把备用木箱搬过来靠着你那边整理吗？」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_5 is 1>>
茶已饮过，改日再来叙话。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-5">
<<mptailoricon>><<link "把毛衣折好 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-5">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_5 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_5")>><<money 450>><span class="gold">你收下了对方备好的贴心馈赠。</span><</if>>羊毛衫叠得方方正正，罗宾安心地靠在你肩头打了个小哈欠。<span class="green">气氛温馨宁静。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木箱底部的旧铁扣勾住了毛线，拉出了一小截线头。<span class="red">你忙收敛力道稳住身形。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拢袖再把毛衣折好 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link "替他敷冻手 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-5">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 400 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_5 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_5_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><span class="gold">你将对方递来的小礼收入囊中。</span><</if>>温热的水汽让罗宾手背恢复红润，他羞赧地反手握住了你的指尖。<span class="green">两人相视一笑。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	水温稍烫了一点，<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>缩了缩手指又怕你担心。<span class="red">准备调整好姿势再来。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦手再替他敷冻手 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Eden 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.season is "autumn" or Time.season is "winter">>深林木屋外的寒风吹过晾肉架，<<else>>深林木屋外的晾肉架下堆着新劈的松木柴，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>正坐在壁炉边用油石打磨猎刀。听见你进门，他朝炉上的铜锅努了努嘴：「鹿肉炖蘑菇好了，先把门口的柴抱进来。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<link [[回伊甸身边 (0:02)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_eden_4 is 1>>
今日已收拾停当，明日再来。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-eden-4">
<<mpfarmicon>><<link "码好松柴 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-4">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11200 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_4 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><<gtrust>><</if>>柴火码得严实稳当，伊甸收起油石，把盛满浓汤的木碗推到你手边。<span class="green">两人相视一笑。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	松树皮上的硬刺扎了一下掌心，柴捆散落了两根。<span class="red">只好先停手歇息片刻。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[侧身再码好松柴 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link "查看晾晒药草 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_4 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><<gtrust>><</if>>你将受潮的火绒挑出来烘在炉石边，伊甸眼底闪过一丝满意的神色。<span class="green">疲惫一扫而空。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你不小心碰洒了一小撮干草药粉末，呛得咳了两声。<span class="red">只好先停手缓神。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓步再查看药草 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Eden 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" or Time.dayState is "night">>风雨夜拍打着林间木屋的木板窗，<<else>>暮色山风拍打着林间木屋的木板窗，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>巡视完外围陷阱回来，斗篷下摆沾着草屑。他把猎枪挂上墙架，走到火炉边将你拉到近前：「狼群在北坡活动，别离火炉太远。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<link [[回伊甸身边 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_eden_5 is 1>>
今天已陪跑一趟，先回吧。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-eden-5">
<<mptailoricon>><<link "挂起湿斗篷 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-5">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_5 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><<gtrust>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_5")>><<money 450>><</if>>斗篷烘出干燥的松烟味，伊甸顺势坐到兽皮毯上把你揽进怀里。<span class="green">狂风暴雨被厚实的圆木墙彻底挡在屋外。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	湿斗篷太沉，挂上木钩时震落了一块炉灰。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>伸手扶稳木钩，拉你在兽皮垫上坐好。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[回手再挂起湿斗篷 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<windowicon>><<link "给弹壳涂蜡 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_5 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><<gtrust>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_5_keepsake")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>>弹壳底座封蜡均匀严密，伊甸难得夸了你一句手巧。<span class="green">他把自己的厚羊毛披肩裹在了你身上。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	蜂蜡还没化透，涂抹时在铜壳上凝成了硬块。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>接过铜壳在火边烘软，手把手教你涂匀。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶墙再给弹壳涂蜡 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Wren 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "dusk" or Time.dayState is "night">>暮色下的旧港栈桥亮起防风马灯，<<else>>旧港栈桥背风的货箱上摆着防风马灯，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>正洗着一副旧纸牌。见你走近，他把一只苹果抛进你怀里，挑眉笑道：「来得正好，帮我盯着点东边岗哨的换班哨。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<link [[回雷恩身边 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_wren_4 is 1>>
今日已核对无误，改天再来。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-wren-4">
<<mpwatchicon>><<link "借阴影看换班 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_wren_4 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><<glove>><</if>>你用两声轻叩报出巡哨转弯的时机，雷恩利落地招呼水手搬完暗箱。<span class="green">眉眼间满是笑意。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海雾太浓晃花了眼，你报错了半分钟的巡逻间隙。<span class="red">手腕一抖失了分寸。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[借光再借阴换班 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "把货签理顺 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-4">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_wren_4 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><<glove>><</if>>二十张货签按船期排得清清楚楚，雷恩满意地拍了拍你的肩膀。<span class="green">心头暖意融融。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	咸湿海风吹跑了两张薄纸签，你追出三步才踩住。<span class="red">你退后半步揉了揉手腕。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓气再把货签理顺 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Wren 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.hour gte 20>>夜班货轮靠岸后，<<else>>傍晚货轮靠岸后，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>在走私栈房里开了一瓶热甜酒。他靠在樟木箱上擦着短匕首，把一枚打着船锚印记的铜牌抛给你：「以后这片船坞的值夜兄弟都认这枚牌子。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<link [[回雷恩身边 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_wren_5 is 1>>
今天已照料周全，先回前头。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-wren-5">
<<mpcleanicon>><<link "擦亮短匕首 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-5">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_wren_5 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><<glove>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_wren_5")>><<money 450>><</if>>刀柄铜护手映出暖黄灯火，雷恩把铜牌系在你腰侧，与你碰了一杯。<span class="green">旧港夜色里你们算得上真正过命的交情。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	刀背的寒气让你指尖一缩，鹿皮布滑落在箱面上。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>收刀入鞘，倒了半杯热甜酒让你暖手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[放轻再擦亮短匕首 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
